1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,390
Your shop is hidden online.

2
00:00:01,766 --> 00:00:04,616
A customer searches near you,
and finds someone else.

3
00:00:05,504 --> 00:00:08,334
WebRivo fixes the map,
the page, and the forms.

4
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,950
Your site goes live.

5
00:00:10,904 --> 00:00:11,714
Three plans.

6
00:00:12,015 --> 00:00:15,025
Basic is 599 a month, one page.

7
00:00:15,311 --> 00:00:17,201
Business is 1,199,

8
00:00:17,691 --> 00:00:19,381
5 pages with SEO.

9
00:00:19,832 --> 00:00:23,942
Premium is 2,199,
with bookings and dashboards.

10
00:00:24,871 --> 00:00:26,501
The estimator builds your mix.

11
00:00:26,797 --> 00:00:29,207
It adds local SEO, maps, payments.

12
00:00:29,548 --> 00:00:30,898
The total updates live.

13
00:00:31,904 --> 00:00:33,034
Pick your domain too.

14
00:00:33,305 --> 00:00:35,295
Business and Premium include one.

15
00:00:35,471 --> 00:00:37,261
Basic gets a free subdomain.

16
00:00:38,138 --> 00:00:39,898
Choose the Send request button.

17
00:00:40,074 --> 00:00:42,624
The form lists your plan,
extras, and the total.

18
00:00:42,895 --> 00:00:45,065
Submit it, and WebRivo follows up.

19
00:00:45,904 --> 00:00:46,614
Get found.

20
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:47,720
Get chosen.

21
00:00:47,976 --> 00:00:49,946
No setup fee, and live in days.

